# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SAMPARK — repository ignore rules
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Secrets and credentials ------------------------------------------------
# The most important block in this file. Real Razorpay keys (rzp_test_*/rzp_live_*)
# and the Anthropic API key live in .env and must never be committed.
# .env.example is the tracked template and is explicitly re-included below.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

secrets/
credentials/
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
# Ed25519 agent keypairs (spec §8.1) — private keys never enter the repo.
*.ed25519
*_private.json

# --- Python virtual environments --------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# --- Python bytecode and build artifacts ------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# --- Test, coverage and type-checker caches ---------------------------------
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
.tox/
.nox/
.hypothesis/
.mypy_cache/
.dmypy.json
.ruff_cache/

# --- Docker local artifacts -------------------------------------------------
# Compose override files are per-machine; the committed compose file is not.
docker-compose.override.yml
docker-compose.override.yaml
.docker/
# Local bind-mount volume data for Postgres/Redis (spec §7).
.data/
pgdata/
redisdata/

# --- IDE and editor ---------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.antigravity/

# --- OS files ---------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# --- Logs -------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
logs/

# --- Generated run output ----------------------------------------------------
# results/*.json is EVIDENCE and is TRACKED (Phase 7 design lock, Decision 11).
# The earlier "generator committed, output not" analogy to Phase 1's dataset did
# not hold: Phase 1's output is regenerable in seconds from a committed pure
# function, whereas a result file is the record OF a Postgres-backed run costing
# minutes per seed, and its evidentiary value rests entirely on
# constants_commit_sha — a precommitment nobody can verify is not one. Spec §19
# lists results/ as a repository directory ("metrics table, sensitivity plots,
# optimality gap, raw runs").
#
# Audit-chain exports remain untracked: sampark/audit/export.py streams
# canonical JSONL at ~10^5 rows, and that is a dump of a database which is
# itself the durable store.
results/*.jsonl
